# Shared by every service whose docker-compose build context is the repo
# root (api-gateway, auth-service, products-service, orders-service,
# inventory-service, billing-service) -- each Dockerfile only ever COPYs
# its own pom.xml/go.mod/src, correlation-commons(-go)/pom.xml+src, and the
# root pom.xml, so excluding everything below never removes a file any
# Dockerfile actually needs.

.git/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Build outputs (rebuilt fresh inside the image every time)
**/target/
**/*.jar
**/*.exe
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.svelte-kit/
frontend/build/

# Logs
**/*.log

# Local env/secrets -- never belong in a build context
**/.env
k8s/base/secrets.yaml

# IDE/OS
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/

# Not needed to build any service image
docs/
observability/
postman/
e2e-tests/
k8s/
*.md
